{"name": "Pig King", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THIS LITTLE PIGGY WOULDN\u2019T DIE\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just because you die doesn't mean you can't commit pig-on-pig violence. Dead players return as zombie pigs, and while they can't use weapons, they can still attack the living... and fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/74ba85f5e70bd96ac0f49d91071855b0.poster.avif?t=1791741181\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/74ba85f5e70bd96ac0f49d91071855b0.webm?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/74ba85f5e70bd96ac0f49d91071855b0.mp4?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THIS LITTLE PIGGY WANTED A THRONE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with weapons, your wits and your snout, it's time to ruin your friendships in the contest for the pig throne! Take on 3 of your closest frenemies and stake your claim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/940a6875366ad5f376cfe4bfa0bb673e.poster.avif?t=1791741181\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/940a6875366ad5f376cfe4bfa0bb673e.webm?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/940a6875366ad5f376cfe4bfa0bb673e.mp4?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THIS LITTLE PIGGY FOUND A TOY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash crates to find items and weapons or use the arena itself to your advantage. Don't forget to fight dirty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ed0064351dd506b226bf2b9569b63808.poster.avif?t=1791741181\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ed0064351dd506b226bf2b9569b63808.webm?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ed0064351dd506b226bf2b9569b63808.mp4?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THIS LITTLE PIGGY FOUND HIS STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Going to commit mud-fueled atrocities against your friends? Might as well look stylish doing it. Customize your hog with the finest, most absurd outfits available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/7637f9e244c878f3d86668580d089243.poster.avif?t=1791741181\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/7637f9e244c878f3d86668580d089243.webm?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/7637f9e244c878f3d86668580d089243.mp4?t=1791741181\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THIS LITTLE PIGGY RAN ALL THE WAY HOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the mud, and wishlist it before your friends beat you to the royal trough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras_big/98927b16478a9ee1482f5b8ec45e88fc.webp?t=1791741181\" height=\"998\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/98927b16478a9ee1482f5b8ec45e88fc.avif?t=1791741181\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The battle for the pig throne has begun! Fight your way to the top in this arena party brawler for up to 4 players.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/d543f15f4597e111c9a0c89c1c6e0e0bf151207f/header.jpg?t=1791741181", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Casual", "Party Game", "3D Platformer", "Arena Shooter", "3D"], "developers": "TwoPeaks", "publishers": "TwoPeaks", "release_date": "Nov 12, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4563590", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "11 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/lI2Enuo5E90", "first_seen": 1791669600.0, "review_rank": 62}